001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.           TFRTUPDG.
001300 AUTHOR.               GAYLE TAYLOR.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.         MAR 14, 1986.
001500*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
001600*REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL ADD, UPDATE, AND DELETE
001700*                      THE FREIGHT CARRIER NAME AND CODE FROM THE
001800*                      KSAM FILE 'CARRIER'.
001900*
002000*
      *C
      *C 11/14/96  JEFF BUNGO  REQUEST 96-035
      *C   ALLOW CARRIER TO BE FLAGGED AS AN EXPEDITE FREIGHT CARRIER.
      *C   USE ENTERS "Y" OR "N", BLANK DEFAULTS TO "N".
      *C
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
002600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002700 FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZFRTUPDG-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
003700     SELECT CARRIER-FILE  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCACARR
003800                          ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
003900                          ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
004000                          RECORD KEY IS CARRIER-CODE
004100                          FILE STATUS IS CARRIER-STAT.
003300 DATA DIVISION.
003400 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC          PIC X(2000).
017000
003500 FD  CARRIER-FILE.
003600 01  CARRIER-RECORD.
003700     05  CARRIER-CODE           PIC X(4).
003800     05  CARRIER-NAME           PIC X(30).
           05  CARRIER-EXPEDITE       PIC X(1).
           05  FILLER                 PIC X(1).
003900
004000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X.

       01  RELATIVE-RECNO         PIC 9(9).
      *------ WS CONTROL AREA
       01  MAJOR-MINOR                 PIC XXXX.
       01  WS-CONTROL.
           02  FUNCTION-NUM            PIC XX.
                   88  EXIT-KEY-F8-USED                     VALUE "08". LVW000LS
                   88  REFRESH-KEY-F4-USED                  VALUE "04". LVW000LS
                   88  ENTER-KEY-USED                       VALUE "00". LVW000LS
                   88  F1-KEY-USED                          VALUE "01". LVW000LS
                   88  F2-KEY-USED                          VALUE "02". LVW000LS
                   88  F3-KEY-USED                          VALUE "03". LVW000LS
                   88  F4-KEY-USED                          VALUE "04". LVW000LS
                   88  F5-KEY-USED                          VALUE "05". LVW000LS
                   88  F6-KEY-USED                          VALUE "06". LVW000LS
                   88  F7-KEY-USED                          VALUE "07". LVW000LS
                   88  F8-KEY-USED                          VALUE "08". LVW000LS
           02 FUN-KEY REDEFINES FUNCTION-NUM PIC XX.
           02 TERMINAL-ID PIC X(10).
           02 FORMAT-NAME PIC X(10).

       01  DISPLAY-STATUS              PIC X(2).

       01  SRF-INDICATORS.
           05  IND OCCURS 99 TIMES   PIC 1 INDICATOR 01.

       COPY IOFEEDBACK OF COPYLIB.
004100 77  ERROR-SW                    PIC X(3)  VALUE "YES".
004200
004300 01  CARRIER-STAT.
004400     05  CARRIER-STAT1           PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
004500     05  CARRIER-STAT2           PIC X     VALUE SPACE.
004600 01  FORM-NAMES.
004700     05  UPD-HEADER              PIC X(8)  VALUE "FRTHDR".
004800     05  ADD-FRT                 PIC X(8)  VALUE "ADDFRT".
004900     05  CHANGE-FRT              PIC X(8)  VALUE "CHGFRT".
005000     05  CHANGE-FRT-2            PIC X(8)  VALUE "CHGFRT2".
005100     05  DELETE-FRT              PIC X(8)  VALUE "DELFRT".
005200     05  DELETE-FRT-2            PIC X(8)  VALUE "DELFRT2".
005300
005400 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
005500     05  MSG-TEXT                  PIC X(68)  VALUE SPACE.
005600     05  MSG-FLD                   PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACE.
005700     05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD   PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
005800
005900 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN                PIC S9(4)  VALUE 76   COMP.
006000 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN                PIC S9(4)  VALUE ZERO  COMP.
006100 01  FIELD-NUMBER                  PIC S9(4)  VALUE 1    COMP.
006200 01  CHANGE-FRT-DBUFLEN            PIC S9(4)  VALUE 34  COMP.
006300 01  DELETE-FRT-DBUFLEN            PIC S9(4)  VALUE 34  COMP.
006400
006500 COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD OF COPYLIB.
006700*************************************************************
006800**         D A T A  E N T R Y  B U F F E R S               **
006900*************************************************************
007000 01  INQHDR-BUFFER.
007100     05  HDR-FRT          PIC X.
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE         PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE         PIC X(79).
007200
007300 01  ADD-FRT-BUFFER.
007400     05  ADD-FRT-CODE     PIC X(4).
007500     05  ADD-FRT-NAME     PIC X(30).
007500     05  ADD-FRT-EXP      PIC X(1).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE2        PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE2        PIC X(79).
007600
007700
007800 01  CHANGE-FRT-HDR-BUFFER.
007900     05  CHG-FRT-CODE-IN         PIC X(4).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE3        PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE3        PIC X(79).
008000 01  CHANGE-FRT-DTL-BUFFER.
008100     05  CHG-FRT-CODE-DISPLAY    PIC X(4).
008200     05  CHG-FRT-NAME-DISPLAY    PIC X(30).
008200     05  CHG-FRT-EXPEDITE        PIC X(1).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE4        PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE4        PIC X(79).
008300
008400
008500 01  DELETE-FRT-HDR-BUFFER.
008600     05  DEL-FRT-CODE-IN         PIC X(4).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE5        PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE5        PIC X(79).
008700 01  DELETE-FRT-DTL-BUFFER.
008800     05  DEL-FRT-CODE-DISPLAY    PIC X(4).
008900     05  DEL-FRT-NAME-DISPLAY    PIC X(30).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE6        PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE6        PIC X(79).
009000
009100 COPY DBCSACCT OF COPYLIB.
009200 COPY DBSTAT   OF COPYLIB.
009300 COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.
009400 01  FORMFILE.
009500     05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(8)  VALUE "FFRTUPDG".
009600     05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
009700     05  FORM-GNAME.
009800         10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
009900         10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
010000     05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
010100
010200 COPY LANGUAGE OF COPYLIB.
010300
010400 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
010500
010600 001-BEGIN SECTION.
010700
010800 010-MAINLINE.
010900     PERFORM 100-BEGIN.
011000     PERFORM 200-PROCESS-UPDATE
011100       UNTIL VIEW-LASTKEY = 3.
011200     PERFORM 1000-CLOSE-FILES.
011300     GOBACK.
011400
011500
011600 100-BEGIN.
011700     MOVE SPACES TO BU-DISPLAY-AREA.
011800     OPEN I-O CARRIER-FILE DISPLAY-FILE.
011900
015500 200-PROCESS-UPDATE.
015600     MOVE UPD-HEADER TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE INQHDR-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO INQHDR-BUFFER.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
036200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 1 OR
036300        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2 OR
036400        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8 OR
036500        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036600        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 7 OR
036700        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6
036800        PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900        GO TO 200-PROCESS-UPDATE.
017200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
017300         NEXT SENTENCE
017400     ELSE
017500         PERFORM 210-SELECT-UPDATE
017600            UNTIL  VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
017700               OR  VIEW-LASTKEY = 7
017800     MOVE "YES" TO ERROR-SW.
017900
018000
018100 210-SELECT-UPDATE.
018500     IF HDR-FRT = "A"
018600         PERFORM 300-ADD-FRT
018700             UNTIL VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR 3
018800     ELSE
018900     IF HDR-FRT = "C"
019000         PERFORM 330-CHANGE-FRT
019100             UNTIL VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR 3
019200     ELSE
019300     IF HDR-FRT = "D"
019400         PERFORM 360-DELETE-FRT
019500             UNTIL VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR 3.
019600
019700 300-ADD-FRT.
019800     MOVE ADD-FRT TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE ADD-FRT-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO ADD-FRT-BUFFER.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
036200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 1 OR
036300        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2 OR
036400        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8 OR
036500        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036700        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6
036800        PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900        GO TO 300-ADD-FRT.
021100     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR 3
021200         NEXT SENTENCE
021300     ELSE
              IF ADD-FRT-EXP NOT = "Y" AND
                 ADD-FRT-EXP NOT = "N" AND
                 ADD-FRT-EXP NOT = " "
      *        "INVALID ENTRY"
                  MOVE  35 TO LANG-SETNUM
                  MOVE 105 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                  PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                  MOVE 5 TO FIELD-NUMBER
                  PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
                  GO TO 300-ADD-FRT
              END-IF
022100        MOVE ADD-FRT-CODE TO CARRIER-CODE
022200        MOVE ADD-FRT-NAME TO CARRIER-NAME
              IF ADD-FRT-EXP = " "
                  MOVE "N" TO CARRIER-EXPEDITE
              ELSE
                  MOVE ADD-FRT-EXP TO CARRIER-EXPEDITE
              END-IF
022400        MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
022500        WRITE CARRIER-RECORD
022600           INVALID KEY PERFORM 820-CHECK-ERROR
022700        END-WRITE
022800        IF MESSAGE-BUFFER NOT = SPACES
022900         PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
023000         IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR 8
023100             NEXT SENTENCE
023200         ELSE
023300             GO TO 300-ADD-FRT.
           MOVE SPACES TO ADD-FRT-BUFFER.

023400 330-CHANGE-FRT.
023500     MOVE CHANGE-FRT TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE CHANGE-FRT-HDR-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO CHANGE-FRT-HDR-BUFFER.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
036200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 1 OR
036300        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2 OR
036400        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8 OR
036500        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036700        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6
036800        PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900        GO TO 330-CHANGE-FRT.
025100     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
025200         NEXT SENTENCE
025300     ELSE
               MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
025400         PERFORM 340-GET-FRT THRU 349-EXIT
025500         IF MESSAGE-BUFFER NOT = SPACES
025600            GO TO 330-CHANGE-FRT.
025700     MOVE "YES" TO ERROR-SW.
025800
025900
026000 340-GET-FRT.
026500     MOVE CHG-FRT-CODE-IN TO CARRIER-CODE.
026600     MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
026700     READ CARRIER-FILE
026900          INVALID KEY PERFORM 820-CHECK-ERROR.
027000     IF MESSAGE-BUFFER NOT = SPACES
027100         PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
027500            GO TO 349-EXIT.
027600
       341-SCREEN.
027700     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR 3
027800        GO TO 349-EXIT
027900     ELSE
028000        MOVE CHANGE-FRT-2 TO VIEW-NFNAME
028700           MOVE CARRIER-CODE TO CHG-FRT-CODE-DISPLAY
028800           MOVE CARRIER-NAME TO CHG-FRT-NAME-DISPLAY
                 MOVE CARRIER-EXPEDITE TO CHG-FRT-EXPEDITE
                 MOVE CHANGE-FRT-DTL-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC
                 WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
                      INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 END-WRITE
                 MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS

                 READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
                      INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 END-READ
                 ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                 MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS
                 MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO CHANGE-FRT-DTL-BUFFER

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
                 IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
                    MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
                 ELSE
                    MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY
                 END-IF
036200        IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 1 OR
036300           VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2 OR
036400           VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8 OR
036500           VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036700           VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6
036800           PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900           GO TO 340-GET-FRT.
030100     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR 3
030200         GO TO 349-EXIT
030300     ELSE
              IF CHG-FRT-EXPEDITE NOT = "Y" AND
                 CHG-FRT-EXPEDITE NOT = "N" AND
                 CHG-FRT-EXPEDITE NOT = " "
      *        "INVALID ENTRY"
                  MOVE  35 TO LANG-SETNUM
                  MOVE 105 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                  PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                  MOVE 6 TO FIELD-NUMBER
                  PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
                  GO TO 341-SCREEN
              END-IF
              IF CHG-FRT-EXPEDITE = " "
                  MOVE "N" TO CHG-FRT-EXPEDITE
              END-IF
030700        PERFORM 350-UPDATE-FRT.

       349-EXIT.  EXIT.
030900 350-UPDATE-FRT.
031000     REWRITE CARRIER-RECORD FROM CHANGE-FRT-DTL-BUFFER
031100             INVALID KEY PERFORM 820-CHECK-ERROR.
031200     MOVE "NO" TO ERROR-SW.
031300
031400 360-DELETE-FRT.
031500     MOVE DELETE-FRT TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE DELETE-FRT-HDR-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
               INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO DELETE-FRT-HDR-BUFFER.

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
           ELSE
               MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
036200     IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 1 OR
036300        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 2 OR
036400        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8 OR
036500        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036700        VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6
036800        PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900        GO TO 360-DELETE-FRT.
031600
033100     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3 OR 7
033200         NEXT SENTENCE
033300     ELSE
               MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
033400         PERFORM 370-GET-FRT THRU 379-EXIT
033500         IF MESSAGE-BUFFER NOT = SPACES
033600                GO TO 360-DELETE-FRT.
033700     MOVE "YES" TO ERROR-SW.
033800
033900
034000 370-GET-FRT.
034400     MOVE DEL-FRT-CODE-IN TO CARRIER-CODE.
034500     MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
034600     READ CARRIER-FILE
034800          INVALID KEY PERFORM 820-CHECK-ERROR.
034900     IF MESSAGE-BUFFER NOT = SPACES
035000         PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
035400         GO TO 379-EXIT.
035500
035600     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR 3
035700         GO TO 379-EXIT
035800     ELSE
              PERFORM 375-SHOW-DEL-SCREEN.
038100     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR 3
038200         GO TO 379-EXIT
038300     ELSE
038400     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 2
038500         PERFORM 380-DELETE-FRT
038600         GO TO 379-EXIT.
038700
           GO TO 370-GET-FRT.
       379-EXIT.  EXIT.

       375-SHOW-DEL-SCREEN.
035900        MOVE DELETE-FRT-2 TO VIEW-NFNAME
036600           MOVE CARRIER-CODE TO DEL-FRT-CODE-DISPLAY
036700           MOVE CARRIER-NAME TO DEL-FRT-NAME-DISPLAY
                 MOVE DELETE-FRT-DTL-BUFFER TO DISPLAY-REC
                 WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
                      INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 END-WRITE
                 MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS

                 READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
                      INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 END-READ
                 ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                 MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS
                 MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO DELETE-FRT-DTL-BUFFER

      *------ A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *------ IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.
                 IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
                    MOVE 3 TO VIEW-LASTKEY
                 ELSE
                    MOVE FUNCTION-NUM TO VIEW-LASTKEY
                 END-IF
036200        IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 1 OR
036400           VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 8 OR
036500           VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 4 OR
036700           VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL 6
036800           PERFORM 940-VSETERROR THRU 949-EXIT
036900           GO TO 375-SHOW-DEL-SCREEN.
038000
038800 380-DELETE-FRT.
039000     DELETE CARRIER-FILE
039100            INVALID KEY
039110        MOVE "DELETE CARRIER-BAD KSAM " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
039120        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.
039200
045500
045600 820-CHECK-ERROR.
045700     IF CARRIER-STAT = "22"
045800*        "CARRIER ALREADY EXISTS"
045900         MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM
046000         MOVE 181 TO LANG-MSGNUM
046100         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
046200     ELSE
046300     IF CARRIER-STAT = "23"
046400*        "*** CARRIER DOES NOT EXIST - REENTER ***"
046500         MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM
046600         MOVE 182 TO LANG-MSGNUM
046700         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
046800     ELSE
046900        PERFORM 990-BLOWUP.
048000
128700 940-VSETERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (99).
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE,
                                  DE-MESSAGE-LINE2
                                  DE-MESSAGE-LINE3
                                  DE-MESSAGE-LINE4
                                  DE-MESSAGE-LINE5
                                  DE-MESSAGE-LINE6.
048600 949-EXIT.  EXIT.
048100************************************************************
048200*                    B L O W U P                           *
048300*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
048400*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
048500*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
048600*                                                          *
048700*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
048800*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
048900*                                                          *
049000*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
049100************************************************************
049200 990-BLOWUP.
049300     MOVE "TFRTUPDG"   TO BU-PGM-NAME.
049400     MOVE VIEW-NFNAME TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
049500     MOVE CARRIER-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2).
049600     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING ACCTG-BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
049700           VIEW-COMAREA, CARRIER-STAT, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
049800           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
049900 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
050000
050100 999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
051700 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
051800     EXIT.
051900
052000 1000-CLOSE-FILES.
052100     CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.
052500     CLOSE CARRIER-FILE.
